# Adapted from the Duskwood portion of fitzforge/polestar
# guides/forever/alliance/07-thousand-needles.guide at
# 1775eb81e56fc1e127ae869ccec0b7dc8d7092fd, GPL-3.0-only.
# The Missing Diplomat detour and default-pack handoffs are omitted.
# Stalvan's evidence is batched with chapters 21/24/25; this chapter finishes it.

step Return to Darkshire
  tip After Excavation Site, return to Darkshire. These quest pickups have lower minimum levels than their combat: later worgen and Plague Spreaders reach about 30-31. Stay with your partner, pull carefully, and postpone a fight for another Excavation Site run if it is too difficult.
  fly "Darkshire"
  sethome "Darkshire" npc 6790
  accept 58 lvl 18
  accept 173 lvl 23

step Nightbane Shadow Weavers
  tip The worgen hold Brightwood, west of Darkshire and north of the road.
  kill 533 quest 173

step Calor
  turnin 173
  accept 221 lvl 23

step Nightbane Dark Runners
  tip Dark Runners prowl the woods south of the road, west of Darkshire.
  kill 205 quest 221

step Calor
  turnin 221
  accept 222 lvl 23

step Nightbane Vile Fangs and Tainted Ones
  tip These stronger worgen are south of Darkshire, west and south of Tranquil Gardens Cemetery. Use your group if solo pulls are unsafe.
  kill 206 quest 222
  kill 920 quest 222

step Darkshire
  turnin 222
  accept 223 lvl 23
  turnin 223
  vendor 228 -- Avette Fellwood: sell low-value loot and repair before restocking drinks at the inn.
  vendor 6790 -- Sell and repair nearby. Keep 10-20 affordable Sweet Nectar for shifting and heals.
  buy 1708 x20 npc 6790 optional

step Abercrombie
  tip Follow the road west to the hermit's shack north-east of Raven Hill Cemetery.
  accept 134 lvl 20

step Plague Spreaders
  tip Plague Spreaders walk the cemetery's northern half. Avoid the roaming elite Mor'Ladim.
  kill 604 quest 58

step Sven's Camp
  accept 323 lvl 20

step Raven Hill Cemetery, west
  tip Skeletal Raiders, Healers and Warders hold the western part of the cemetery, just east of Sven's camp.
  kill 1110 quest 323
  kill 787 quest 323
  kill 785 quest 323

step Raven Hill: Crimes Against Anatomy
  collect 209849 "Crimes Against Anatomy" @16.7,28.5 map 1431 era -- The book is at the end of the western crypt. Pick it up only if the passage is already safe; otherwise skip this pickup and return to Sven.

step Sven's Camp
  turnin 323
  accept 269 lvl 20

step Vul'Gol Ogre Mound
  tip Collect Abercrombie's Crate near the camp entrance, then finish Look to the Stars in the cave. Zzarc' Vul is level 30: bring your partner and clear carefully. If the fight is too difficult, keep the quest for after another dungeon run. If a Lost Watcher dropped Merrick's Bow, finish its optional ogre kills here too; do not farm for that random drop.
  collect 1349 quest 134 @33.4,76.3
  collect 1968 npc 300 x1 quest 181.1 group 2 -- Zzarc' Vul drops the Ogre's Monocle; combine this with the existing ogre-camp visit.
  accept 96138 item 281142 lvl 18 optional
  kill 212 x8 quest 96138.1 optional
  kill 892 x4 quest 96138.2 optional

step Abercrombie
  turnin 134
  accept 160 lvl 20

