  turnin 181                                 -- Viktori Prism'Antras: the monocle collected at Vul'Gol.

step Stalvan at Mistmantle Manor
  tip Stalvan is level 32 in the house northeast of Darkshire. This finish is optional before 30: do it with your leveling partner using controlled pulls. If solo or the fight is unsafe, retain the quest for a later visit instead of fighting a level-32 named enemy underlevelled. This completes the evidence gathered during earlier travel.
  collect 3629 npc 315 quest 98.1 group 2 optional
  turnin 98 optional

step Continue through Stormwind toward Southshore
  note Our next chapter hands in the held city quests, finishes the Stockades investigation, then adds outdoor Southshore XP on the way to Dalaran. No uncounted dungeon repeats are required by this handoff.
